sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Dosen (token user)
    participant G as Gateway (PEP + PA)
    participant NV as Service Nilai
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant TV as Service Transkrip

    D->>G: POST /kelas/1/finalisasi<br/>Bearer + X-Device-ID
    Note over G: PE: kelas.finalize —<br/>admin? jam akses? pemilik kelas?
    G->>NV: proxy (secret + token terverifikasi ulang)
    activate NV
    NV->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT kelas FOR UPDATE (hanya tabel kelas)
    NV->>DB: semua nilai terisi? tidak → ROLLBACK → 422 GRADES_INCOMPLETE
    NV->>DB: UPDATE nilai SET status='FINAL' WHERE kelas_id=? AND status='DRAFT'
    NV->>DB: UPDATE kelas SET finalized_at=?, sync_status=PENDING, lalu COMMIT
    NV->>G: POST /auth/service<br/>client_id + client_secret
    G-->>NV: token service (typ=service, 5 mnt)<br/>audit SERVICE_TOKEN_ISSUED
    NV->>G: POST /transkrip/sinkron (Bearer token service)
    Note over G: PE: transkrip.sync — hanya service,<br/>token user → USER_TOKEN_ON_SERVICE_ENDPOINT
    G->>TV: proxy (secret + re-verify token)
    alt transkrip berhasil
        TV->>DB: INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE<br/>(idempoten, UNIQUE nim+kelas_id)
        TV-->>NV: 200 upserted
        NV->>DB: sync_status='SYNCED'
        NV-->>D: 200 sync_status=SYNCED
    else transkrip mati / error
        TV--xNV: gagal
        NV->>DB: sync_status='FAILED'
        NV-->>D: 502 SYNC_FAILED — panggil ulang untuk retry<br/>(finalized_at tidak berubah, upsert idempoten)
    end
    deactivate NV
